yText", "text": "Uterine artery embolization for retractable hemorrhage PPH, when conventional medical and surgical measures fail, uterine artery embolization (UAE) offers a life-saving, uterus-sparing alternative. Minimally invasive alternative to hysterectomy in higher centers.", "runs": [{"text": "Uterine artery embolization for retractable hemorrhage PPH, when conventional medical and surgical measures fail, uterine artery embolization (UAE) offers a life-saving, uterus-sparing alternative. Minimally invasive alternative to hysterectomy in higher centers."}]}, {"id": "body-10831", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-10832", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Provide the “clinical care bundle- first response bundle for PPH”:", "runs": [{"text": "Provide"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "“clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "care"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bundle-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "first"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "response"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bundle"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "PPH”:"}]}, {"id": "body-10833", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Start", "runs": [{"text": "Start"}]}, {"id": "body-10834", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: oxytocin (IV) 20IU in 500mls sodium lactate compound (ringer’s lactate)or 0.9% sodium chloride (IV) titrate at 20 drops per minute", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "oxytocin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(IV)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "20IU"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "500mls"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sodium"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lactate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "compound"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(ringer’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lactate)or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.9%"